    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know you say that but i really dont want to deal with the emergency room right now, it's such a hassle and my insurance is a pain. i feel okay now that i'm sitting down. do you think it's possible it's just my blood pressure being a little off because of the heat? like, can i just try to fix it myself with some electrolytes and a nap and see how i feel tomorrow?",
