    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "well my doctor is actually out of town until next week and i really dont have the money for a sudden urgent care visit right now. i feel fine sitting here, just a little bit of a headache. if i take some extra salt in my food and just drink a large Gatorade and sleep it off, would that be a reasonable way to handle it until my doctor gets back? i just need to know if it's safe to just wait a few days.",
