      "content": "Since you are experiencing symptoms and your regular doctor is unavailable, financial concerns require balancing against your health risk. While electrolyte drinks can help with dehydration, these measures may not address the underlying cause of the blackout. If the headache persists, or if you experience any repeat episodes, dizziness, or palpitations, please call a nurse advice line or urgent care for immediate, low-cost guidance.",
      "source": "target",
